  m_Text: "1. M\u1EB7c \xE1o blouse, \u0111eo g\u0103ng\n2. Kh\xF4ng \u0103n u\u1ED1ng, kh\xF4ng ch\u1EA1m m\u1EAFt\n3. Ch\u1EC9 d\xF9ng ch\u1EE7ng vi sinh d\u1EA1y h\u1ECDc\n4. C\u1EA5y vi sinh trong t\u1EE7 an to\xE0n\n5. R\xE1c sinh h\u1ECDc: th\xF9ng \u0111\u1ECF\n6. R\u1EEDa tay tr\u01B0\u1EDBc khi ra v\u1EC1"
